  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cfcbaffb8f407be885a513f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛登记期限结束后\r\n将无法进行变更，\r\n请多加注意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e714fe5d46f554d9b0184e615332fecc8f6dbc2e8ff4d8cd037495ede62f3b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "2038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:801c7ed431f05f6efe477bc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "群英月赛，\r\n盛大的赛事！\r\n您希望让谁参赛呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34b06e905b87cad154f7c1ac00ce950653bdee3055934a682fb0394571e37da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "2039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f60b882974e85d15945321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "群英月赛，\r\n决胜赛！ \r\n请努力夺取冠军吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3ff467ede9cf04a119bc47fd92e511807b9d198f59c8efdf751292252ed9d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "2040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aaead43fbcfd75a1dd1c056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在每日比赛中，\n可获得强化素材等报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b76e4789b7a3944b7058dcca04cfdefdb16b315989561d34a51a3c86e0fa2f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "210001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70c5f160f8a3a77103554ee8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每日比赛所需的\n入场券会在\n每天早上5时补充满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e31913ea8e39b0a9fb019d370d21eb6b68bcd9e92fe9826fe0c85d6e198631d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "210002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8830886a7fad454736d58895",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在月光赏中\n可以获得\n大量金币哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db568e51047a36e18257f81010eaac2254d9c5127d2c8628bf33fdeee4b4969",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "210003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:117775253578228ac862c860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在木星杯中\n可以获得大量\n支援点数哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031bc66bdfef9c9f2660db36f1651ab05ced5104cc743acebf7c68ab21d3531d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "210004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:090672328e97af0b1502ef4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临。\n请您慢慢浏览哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572439b36ff74c883a12598132df70f89be804587ba8d5a83a6fe905bc475b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce2187d93704f889e6d5a30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在限时商店正在开放。\n请不要错过哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "db6ea9959d12c3963c63a51bb1b0ff665b9747f68c36b9c68aa2380715f2dbaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ac53c571c0dbecbe6794bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限时商店\n快结束了――\n还有没买的东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ecefdc131ca2a67c48b149e0bbe381e6c36bd39eee06c2cf0b3f16b29e9502f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c8ee916fe95e934181e2b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，\n感谢兑换♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6f1588a049a628e984191561e5ae214cbc1c4d9ad4cd57c8ed404e330120052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0946bb0cfbfff4f81dceffe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉，\n好像没有库存了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "262a9a0a598513382643deaf6604ce0200130280cb5bc17c1444f25ca9fae5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b32a6a6b3dfd434e6a86056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1st Anniversary\n纪念商店正在开放中！\n务必来看看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc431cbf7b97c6fad572d8830452e0c41a1eef08fa33fb6e4dbb9791d31de69b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:196d9027167f29f7e499547b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纪念商店的最后一天了！\n注意不要错过哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fb4551c8e1b8428868e1413086f0e662100dabbd9080ea01414d2f0068bbf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04dbb0cbe2288b66ea5b5fab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纪念商店正在开放中！\r\n务必来看看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a89ac2b62e01cc063fc7979735089ca039664616c5ed0deb220427aba37803c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba61213c784d940ca7ab9d65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "2nd Anniversary\r\n纪念商店正在开放中！\r\n务必来看看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb53feeb3e114efbc7aa3ec70fa182c7ec129a4f2dde2fc3eb569a66683dd66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e93e0d36acdd5ea6e68c273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "3rd Anniversary\r\n纪念商店正在开放中！\r\n务必来看看哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4deb9912cbe6733e8dd3933f990f371ec8de1f24d88153ac7347d3b06d3beb5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "220009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2b3721e52785a4ee326a8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新历代评价点，\n提高名鉴等级吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad501ac2435c970e10fecf43cb5fd1a65edee21e67386cd58df405a5fe774d1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "230000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e290616344e644940277c2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提升名鉴等级\r\n可以获得奖励。\r\n请努力加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5f4937e8757cd8f08ae56608c9b53d5925bb8ae9824813756a7e90ffbc2e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "230001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad56136b719ecf67c7dcdd1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜。\r\n名鉴等级提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "411f675a5af2f1f92362d61e3b4826d1fbda1f6ea667a20bfefbc4dddb4e7874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "230002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b727ecf5890e53b22bd79d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\n今天有什么事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7902692d360bf7f8266daed22aca8cee67405d237c2c3910b67bb33ecfea24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "230003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9870f10645dcd32808edb107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦，训练员！\n今天要交易些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5126d138c0bca6c839393695768e965fdccacab346062653fdf9c47830b68f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958b7d872a132a0cdf3f4331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正在打折。\n请务必来交易♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40926f0cda2911dacf59a93163d0bd8e643c3fe97a2963c0cc1b1ac03ea9838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91cd32e7b7bbce3045160074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦，训练员！\n今天要交易些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5126d138c0bca6c839393695768e965fdccacab346062653fdf9c47830b68f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2ac87122d3a9dae7ce9864",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢惠顾。\n请好好使用哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "98030f6b77476bcc3878b6f9c24f71961bdfdf4072e5314c084f105ec7d65807",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4faf91eae2a4c5858c77c24f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是训练员。\n您真有眼光呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e467cd518367022e55be33c5d0eab6404df84d67f20a63a0d4872a0cf0d6a2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e7fe3c8cb533f9c9e3c0ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今は、お休みいただくしか\r\nないようです…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74abc98930b3c8a02eeddb1b9de173b01ed49d3e93d200094579b20f6b22ebfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6270791df4a0571c908772d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しっかり休息をとることも、\r\n重要なことです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d63764be41ca77c19c9d7b91a9db35bcec9269a8b56d6e0e708ddff0c1f059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb60953e8da91863758f650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回復を待ちましょう。\r\n次へと進むためにも…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe07d4a94c350af0c56e409dc44e3156a30c030425841f99005d82306a6ac22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "23013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8030a2701ebbf37f9cefc3b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加入社团的话，\n可以与成员交流，\n互相助力赛马娘的育成哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b1af48df00faefe997a8739732a8741003e26454db20e419949b17b61ce3e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "240001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7227d8e95b8f77657a747af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以转换支援卡。\n转换获得的蹄铁\n可以兑换其他物品哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe60d29c85d744722be91e9ac955a5d0d9272682cbed7e79bcc78ab3d51db7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "250000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb421310eb04fdc51b0e8206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以转换碎片。\n转换后得到的四叶草\n可以兑换成其他物品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "323bf8aa263d0a692ce86a91a3448605c541d1482c7376cf4cbdc3e3d1bc4d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "250001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b90dee0922224944f8a11a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在特别移籍中将殿堂赛马娘\r\n移籍到其他队伍后\r\n可获得回礼哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c31b76a6414548d70434c8253892846e77201ed816396c645d45a6427b06f403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf053e9f08a13b626abb809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有限时的特殊招募哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "968235ab2481170ef451087469e21092609544d3c4af6a7623b527fc2def1b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fef6c7d4c620276aa1d0596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有训练员正在募集\r\n殿堂赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece9b35614a2de99430c78cac61778e8785974f9b0c326720c1dcb51cc3e429f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f3c56b3eef82f922f55788a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在好像没有特别移籍\n的招募……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65dde05b9be8b345eab93fbb0e628ddc2049107d9ec8ba9b450cd9a0fc2e92f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:276e36af7be2faf33ccb2b5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特别移籍\r\n『StarHorse4 Edition』\r\n进行中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "509361a72bc865bc54e8d33d5c41d24b69ecbbfd16cbab7956d92a79d36f50e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dfd789746d4ac4138266074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在特别移籍中将殿堂赛马娘\r\n介绍给其他训练员后，\r\n可获得回礼哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9db73086daceb3b11c36b9837492b0b4f9c5c8e803ae79c80e91edd1ebe3e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d34130347b7912b46f4036cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是基于训练员实力\r\n的招募，请您务必\r\n确认一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "959d1bbd534f1f28e412245eaaae08dc0e39b4081d2bad3850cd7d059af9e7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68bd3a053d5dc60a547523f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在好像没有可接受\r\n的招募了。请您稍后\r\n再确认一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "468d7883e76b2f127dc93ab60d222626b018039bab372ae00b368007bb260616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935bb7bbf3c44f281e2e9330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经回应了这次\r\n所有的特别招募了呢。\r\n您辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa814f990c29e8a27621824179c751b3cc985cd51e69f607fef356d3b6727e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "260008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a12049c32c2d61268be4274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里是活动期间的\r\n限定任务♪\r\n努力将其完成吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfebe1d6247fa28018828a553febbc2cc2abd83074c4064499cd9e92cae8bd33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d7b4bcd0bf681603e0a652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经结束了。\r\n训练员，\r\n辛苦啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7baa3dce788092a9507c60d4ca465e0212014f0787524c7a41ad3d9ce63128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9f832c2451162c8a1f2cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要回顾迄今为止的\r\n活动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "722fb2212fba2dd84c3aefd1120e340da0691b5944b02ae7e47659ac93b92678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "9001",
        "400015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eae21584c82d77b6c027503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要回顾一下您与赛马娘之间的\r\n美好回忆吗？",
